data: {"id": "ccac2d87f6324ca9-final", "run_id": "ccac2d87f6324ca9", "seq": 2745, "ts_ms": 1789381649954, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v15/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | 容器启动时尝试分配256Mi内存，超过`limits.memory`设定的64Mi硬限制，触发OOMKilled，导致进程以退出码137终止并进入CrashLoopBackOff循环。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason`: {\"container\": \"app\", \"reason\": \"OOMKilled\"} (fact-51f480238127) | 确认容器被系统强制终止，直接归因为内存超限 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.memory`: 64Mi (fact-27f0963a198a) | 提供故障判定基准，确认为 64Mi 硬限制 |\n| 3 | Logging | elasticsearch | `log.message`: \"startup allocation 256Mi\" (fact-5666220a64f9) | 记录进程启动阶段的实际内存请求，证实超过上限 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `BackOff restarting failed container app` (fact-9fe998cbdc4d) | 展现因 OOM 导致的崩溃循环现象 |\n\n证据间互相印证：Logging 指出应用试图申请 256Mi，K8s Config 确认硬限制仅为 64Mi，K8s State 与 K8s Event 记录证实该超额尝试直接触发了 `OOMKilled` (fact-51f480238127) 及后续的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 重启循环 (fact-945356d308c6)。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器配置硬限制为64Mi → 进程启动时尝试申请256Mi内存 → 触发OOMKilled强制终止(退出码137) → 进入CrashLoopBackOff循环\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **内存资源配置冲突（Request > Limit）**。\n\n根据事实支撑：\n1. **K8s 状态**明确显示容器被 `OOMKilled` (fact-51f480238127)，证明进程在启动初期即触发了系统的 OOM Killer。\n2. **配置事实**记录了 `limits.memory` 仅为 `64Mi` (fact-27f0963a198a)。\n3. **日志事实**记录 `startup allocation 256Mi` (fact-5666220a64f9)，证实应用启动时的内存需求远超硬限制。\n\n上述三组事实构成完整证据链，确证根因为容器启动时所需内存（256Mi）显著超出其 `limits.memory` 硬限制（64Mi），导致无法分配内存而被系统杀死并循环重启。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 38.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 71.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v15/workload: 71.7s (Evidence 65.5s, RCA 6.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v15/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 119.842, "metrics": {"run_id": "ccac2d87f6324ca9", "mttr": {"value": "2.0m", "seconds": 119.85254192352295, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 119852.54192352295, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 88472.60928153992, "tool_calls": 18, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 6, "successful_tool_calls": 18, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 11983.968496322632, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4718.369960784912}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 38931.663274765015, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 71706.40826225281, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidenc